{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"Footnote 5 repeats demonstration without an express request condition. The executable preserves the question's stipulated request-conditioned reading; it does not resolve the rival reading that demonstration is independently required by the footnote. The reach of the high-confidence qualification also remains unresolved.\",\"TRUE_IS_SATISFIED denotes satisfaction of the request condition only. Neither Boolean result establishes confirmation, demonstration, SFC satisfaction, adequate supervision, operational soundness or accurate ownership records.\",\"Paragraphs 15 and 16 impose distinct request-conditioned audit/verification and legal-opinion duties. A paragraph 14 demonstration request does not automatically activate either.\",\"The ownership-record and compatibility provision, Code 6.8 register requirements, valuation-specific Code 6.11C supervision standard, and intermediary provisions 13 and 17–18 do not supply additional conditions for this narrowly typed trigger. Their applicability cannot be assumed to establish provider fulfillment.\",\"Full paragraphs 10–13 and the referenced Appendix factors are not supplied. They would be needed to assess the complete substantive demonstration or fulfillment standard, but their absence does not prevent assessment of this stipulated trigger.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The supplied paragraph 10 and footnote 1 establish continuing responsibility directly; no additional external authority is needed for this claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"deferred.9d6ef75f1b5f4ae94e41f5d5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.0014cf34bf89a0c967381f17\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Continuing responsibility is outside the demonstration-activation question. Its absence from the trigger formula is not an omission relative to that question.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],