ions\":[\"Does footnote 5 specify only minimum demonstration content, or independently require demonstration without an SFC request?\",\"Does the high-confidence qualification apply only to absence of smart-contract vulnerabilities and security flaws, or also to compliance with paragraphs 10–13?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"span_ids\":[\"span.cd526c3070c27fe20eeb5b5747cd3243b3258fd8f5f6561ae6d208cd715a1c78\"]},{\"span_ids\":[\"span.acf60b57572e8ea782c4885e35fc3c9f6fdf357f190752d7274b9b732d82ee82\"]}],\"question_hash\":\"0b59742c020d7fae2612f418b62d0f6d929bff0b42768c9c24d1d829a8f0c9c9\",\"rationale\":\"The claim supplies the very request condition tested by the typed question, which expressly adopts the reading that footnote 5 specifies content without removing that condition.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"span_ids\":[\"span.cd526c3070c27fe20eeb5b5747cd3243b3258fd8f5f6561ae6d208cd715a1c78\"]},{\"span_ids\":[\"span.acf60b57572e8ea782c4885e35fc3c9f6fdf357f190752d7274b9b732d82ee82\"]}],\"rationale\":\"Paragraph 14 expressly supports demonstration upon request of all three specified matters to SFC satisfaction. Footnote 5 adds minimum content. The positive duty upon request is supported under either reading; the stronger inference that no demonstration duty exists without a request remains interpretive.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}}]}"}}
